dentified the TGF-beta/Smad3 pathway as a key downstream pathway of LHPP in vivo and in vitro. The effect of LHPP deficiency was reversed by inhibiting the TGF-beta/Smad3 pathway in liver fibrosis. These results revealed that LHPP deficiency exacerbates liver fibrosis through the TGF-beta/Smad3 pathway. LHPP may be a potential therapeutic target in hepatic fibrosis.\n\n",
